      "value": "@{5a95256f54d514123c1f089d|full_name}: I'd like to say this feature would be semi-implemented with the avatar performance settings. The real struggle with feature requests is how important keeping the GUI simple for new users is, as VRChat (as you are very fond of) is a free-to-play platform funded by Valve to get people to switch from PC to VR. \nThis feature request could likely be the same as a request for advanced avatar blocking settings.\n[Off-Topic] You appear to use Unity for VRChat, so I'd like to chat on VRChat, I additionally have some queries about quest compatibility. [ User: FurriestWolf ]",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
