      "value": "Even with all the comments of whatever this could mean i say no.\nEven restricting how tall avatars can be. Some people have fun with that. Some avatars is just tall and thats it. Like some avatars is just small.\n\nPerformance settings does go in if its too heavi and you havent turned it off. Else you can just block peoples avatars.\n\nIf you mean height adjustment in settings, then a huge no. Thats very needed and should never be limited.",
